          <dmn:text>[{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;query&quot;, &quot;params&quot;: [{&quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;- relativedelta(years=1)&quot;, &quot;effective_to&quot;: &quot;- relativedelta(years=1)&quot;}]}, {&quot;type&quot;: &quot;instruction&quot;, &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;1. Clearly state the reference year in the answer.2. Add a disclaimer that the requested year&apos;s data has not been officially published yet.&quot;}]</dmn:text>
