          <dmn:text>[{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;instruction&quot;, &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;1. Answer based on the most relevant available data that matches the user intent. 2. Clearly state the scope or basis of the data used. 3. If the answer is based on a reference or general case, explicitly state this limitation without implying missing or unpublished time-specific data.&quot;}]</dmn:text>
